flowchart TD
    subgraph Sources["Source Repositories"]
        SPI[science-platform-images]
        NBR[notebooks-repo]
    end

    subgraph Local["Local Curator Workflow — never pushed to GHCR"]
        USER((User))
        SPEC1[wrangler spec]
        WRANGLER[nb-wrangler<br/>resolves package constraints]
        SPEC2[wrangler spec<br/>+ package & data locks]
        LDOCKER[Docker build - local]
        LTEST[local end-to-end image test<br/>verifies spec & image correctness]
    end

    IMG_REPO[(nb-wrangler-images<br/>on GitHub)]
    HANDOFF{{tooling + spec handed off<br/>to GitHub Actions}}

    SPI -->|common image package requirements| SPEC1
    NBR -->|notebooks, per-notebook requirements.txt,<br/>refdata_dependencies.yaml| SPEC1
    USER -->|adds inline package, data, environment,<br/>image requirements| SPEC1

    SPEC1 -.->|optional: user runs nb-wrangler locally| WRANGLER
    WRANGLER -.->|resulting package & data locks<br/>added back to the spec| SPEC2

    USER -.->|optional: build test image locally| LDOCKER
    LDOCKER -.->|local image for local e2e testing only| LTEST

    SPEC2 -->|user adds spec & tooling| IMG_REPO
    IMG_REPO --> HANDOFF